+# Owner-directed reference designation — 2026-10-20
+
+The current owner requested careful reconciliation of all INBOX documents, explicit prioritization of IMPOERTANT.md and lesson extraction into classified instructions, and conversion of the current candidate into an updated reference. This is the recorded authority for package editing, local reference designation and its catalog entry after successful local verification.
+
+The original candidate and its archive are preserved separately. Exact before/after file hashes, a unified text diff and raw checks are held by the Studio delivery receipt; original source hashes and the bounded item review are included in [INBOX_SOURCES.json](INBOX_SOURCES.json) and [INBOX_RECONCILIATION.json](INBOX_RECONCILIATION.json).
+
+Reference designation is scoped to the local package. It does not claim independent release acceptance, native host/model qualification, external publication or activation in any consumer project. Those observations remain separately recorded. The 47 existing rules and four-contract architecture are preserved; this update implements their governed learning procedure rather than adding synonymous rule IDs.
